ansible-playbook -i inventory.ini patch_reboot_phase2.yml -u sysadmin --become

For limited testing:
ansible-playbook -i inventory.ini patch_reboot_phase2.yml -u sysadmin --become --limit servername

For syntax check:
ansible-playbook --syntax-check patch_reboot_phase2.yml

For dry run, I would not fully trust check mode for patching, but you can still do:
ansible-playbook -i inventory.ini patch_reboot_phase2.yml -u sysadmin --become --check

